# Slick Sequence: "Slick Sequence deals 2 damage to any target. If you've cast another spell this turn, draw a card." On turn 3 it
# is the only spell Bot1 casts that turn (the four Moxen were cast on turn 1, which does not count): it kills Bot2's Memnite, an
# opponent's creature, and Bot1 draws nothing, though Bot2 casts a Dark Ritual in response ("you've cast": an opponent's spell
# does not count); a Mox, no creature, player, planeswalker or battle, is refused as a target. On turn 5
# Bot1 casts a Lightning Bolt first and then the second Slick Sequence at itself, an own target, 2 damage to Bot1: it draws a card, as
# the Bolt is another spell (CR 601.2i), while the Sequence's own cast is not. Bot2 takes 3 from the Bolt.

